  "releaseNotes": "Initial stable release.\n\t\t\t- In-memory keyed asynchronous lock provider\n\t\t\t- Thread-safe synchronization\n\t\t\t- Automatic lock lifecycle management\n\t\t\t- Dependency Injection integration\n\t\t\t- Production-ready implementation\n\t\t\t1.1.0: targets net8.0, net9.0 and net10.0. No public API or behavior change; the net9.0 and net10.0 assets are new, and the net8.0 asset is unchanged.\n\t\t\t1.1.1: Dependency refresh on net10.0. Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection.Abstractions 10.0.13 to 10.0.15. The target framework declarations (net8.0;net9.0;net10.0) moved to the central Directory.Packages.props. No code or API changes.",
